{"id":"4c916f34e9cc3391","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-natural-deduction.md","title":"Natural Deduction","display":"df-natural-deduction — Natural Deduction","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-natural-deduction","aliases":["72-df-natural-deduction"],"display":"df-natural-deduction — Natural Deduction","depends_on":["[[72-df-calculus-syntax]]","[[72-df-sequent-rule]]","[[72-df-proof-tree]]","[[72-df-gentzen-system]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.I §2.4.8 print47–48/PDF59–60; explicit assumption-class finite-tree presentation","verification_status":"source-statement-checked; explicit local encoding checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"消除开放假设/结论投影的零基与一基歧义"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-natural-deduction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-natural-deduction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-natural-deduction — Natural Deduction"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3c073b947b255638\" href=\"?note=3c073b947b255638\" title=\"72-df-calculus-syntax\">72-df-calculus-syntax</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d940a4cbbc0bf9c9\" href=\"?note=d940a4cbbc0bf9c9\" title=\"72-df-sequent-rule\">72-df-sequent-rule</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"81c9c855e009a6d4\" href=\"?note=81c9c855e009a6d4\" title=\"72-df-proof-tree\">72-df-proof-tree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c60a11e47ac58326\" href=\"?note=c60a11e47ac58326\" title=\"72-df-gentzen-system\">72-df-gentzen-system</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.I §2.4.8 print47–48/PDF59–60; explicit assumption-class finite-tree presentation"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked; explicit local encoding checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"消除开放假设/结论投影的零基与一基歧义"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3c073b947b255638\" href=\"?note=3c073b947b255638\" title=\"72-df-calculus-syntax\">72-df-calculus-syntax</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_\\Sigma\">\\(X_\\Sigma\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_N\">\\(X_N\\)</span> 为没有原始 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\">\\(\\neg\\)</span> 节点的公式，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\">\\(\\neg A\\)</span> 在本文件缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to\\bot\">\\(A\\to\\bot\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H,K,L\">\\(H,K,L\\)</span> 为有限假设类标注函数，域是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 的有限子集，值是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_N\">\\(X_N\\)</span>；同一标签 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 可标记多个相同公式的假设叶。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>以下每个集合构造中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H,K,L\">\\(H,K,L\\)</span> 遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Asm}\">\\(\\mathsf{Asm}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,C\">\\(A,B,C\\)</span> 遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_N\">\\(X_N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i,j\\in\\omega\">\\(i,j\\in\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in V\">\\(x,y\\in V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span>；所有显示的判断必须属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q_N\">\\(Q_N\\)</span>，因而它们的假设并必须仍是函数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{jud}_N(H,A)\">\\(\\operatorname{jud}_N(H,A)\\)</span> 缩写有序对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle H,A\\rangle\">\\(\\langle H,A\\rangle\\)</span>，不表示推导已成立。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_i^A(H)\">\\(U_i^A(H)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_i^A(H)\">\\(G_i^A(H)\\)</span> 分别为以下解除操作和标签一致性条件。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(H)=\\bigcup_{A\\in\\operatorname{ran}(H)}\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}(H)=\\bigcup_{A\\in\\operatorname{ran}(H)}\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(A)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{tag}_R\">\\(\\mathsf{tag}_R\\)</span> 为与下列各关系对应的互异固定标签。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D\\in\\{\\mathbf{NJ}_\\Sigma,\\mathbf{NK}_\\Sigma\\}\">\\(\\mathcal D\\in\\{\\mathbf{NJ}_\\Sigma,\\mathbf{NK}_\\Sigma\\}\\)</span> 是演算参数，不是规则关系集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R_N\">\\(\\mathcal R_N\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OpenAsm}\">\\(\\operatorname{OpenAsm}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NDConcl}\">\\(\\operatorname{NDConcl}\\)</span> 只在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal D}\">\\(\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal D}\\)</span> 上定义。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nX_N&amp;:=\\{A\\in X_\\Sigma:\\neg\\exists B\\in X_\\Sigma\\ (\\langle\\mathsf{not},B\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{Sf}_{72}(A))\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{Asm}&amp;:=\\{H\\subseteq\\omega\\times X_N:|H|\\in\\omega\\land\\forall i,A,B\\ ((\\langle i,A\\rangle\\in H\\land\\langle i,B\\rangle\\in H)\\to A=B)\\},\\\\\nQ_N&amp;:=\\mathsf{Asm}\\times X_N,\\quad \\operatorname{jud}_N(H,A):=\\langle H,A\\rangle,\\\\\nU_i^A(H)&amp;:=H\\setminus\\{\\langle i,A\\rangle\\},\\qquad G_i^A(H):\\Longleftrightarrow i\\notin\\operatorname{dom}(H)\\lor\\langle i,A\\rangle\\in H,\\\\\n\\mathsf{Ax}_N&amp;:=\\{\\operatorname{jud}_N(\\{\\langle i,A\\rangle\\},A):i\\in\\omega,A\\in X_N\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nX_N&amp;:=\\{A\\in X_\\Sigma:\\neg\\exists B\\in X_\\Sigma\\ (\\langle\\mathsf{not},B\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{Sf}_{72}(A))\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{Asm}&amp;:=\\{H\\subseteq\\omega\\times X_N:|H|\\in\\omega\\land\\forall i,A,B\\ ((\\langle i,A\\rangle\\in H\\land\\langle i,B\\rangle\\in H)\\to A=B)\\},\\\\\nQ_N&amp;:=\\mathsf{Asm}\\times X_N,\\quad \\operatorname{jud}_N(H,A):=\\langle H,A\\rangle,\\\\\nU_i^A(H)&amp;:=H\\setminus\\{\\langle i,A\\rangle\\},\\qquad G_i^A(H):\\Longleftrightarrow i\\notin\\operatorname{dom}(H)\\lor\\langle i,A\\rangle\\in H,\\\\\n\\mathsf{Ax}_N&amp;:=\\{\\operatorname{jud}_N(\\{\\langle i,A\\rangle\\},A):i\\in\\omega,A\\in X_N\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ImpI}_\\Sigma&amp;:=\\{\\langle\\langle \\operatorname{jud}_N(H,B)\\rangle,\\operatorname{jud}_N(U_i^A(H),A\\to B)\\rangle:G_i^A(H)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{ImpE}_\\Sigma&amp;:=\\{\\langle\\langle \\operatorname{jud}_N(H,A\\to B),\\operatorname{jud}_N(K,A)\\rangle,\\operatorname{jud}_N(H\\cup K,B)\\rangle:H\\cup K\\in\\mathsf{Asm}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{AndI}_\\Sigma&amp;:=\\{\\langle\\langle \\operatorname{jud}_N(H,A),\\operatorname{jud}_N(K,B)\\rangle,\\operatorname{jud}_N(H\\cup K,A\\land B)\\rangle:H\\cup K\\in\\mathsf{Asm}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{AndE}_\\Sigma&amp;:=\\{\\langle\\langle \\operatorname{jud}_N(H,A\\land B)\\rangle,\\operatorname{jud}_N(H,C)\\rangle:C\\in\\{A,B\\}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{OrI}_\\Sigma&amp;:=\\{\\langle\\langle \\operatorname{jud}_N(H,C)\\rangle,\\operatorname{jud}_N(H,A\\lor B)\\rangle:C\\in\\{A,B\\}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{OrE}_\\Sigma&amp;:=\\{\\langle\\langle \\operatorname{jud}_N(H,A\\lor B),\\operatorname{jud}_N(K,C),\\operatorname{jud}_N(L,C)\\rangle,\\operatorname{jud}_N(H\\cup U_i^A(K)\\cup U_j^B(L),C)\\rangle:\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{16mm}G_i^A(K)\\land G_j^B(L)\\land H\\cup U_i^A(K)\\cup U_j^B(L)\\in\\mathsf{Asm}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{TopI}_\\Sigma&amp;:=\\{\\langle\\langle\\rangle,\\operatorname{jud}_N(\\varnothing,\\top)\\rangle\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{BotE}_\\Sigma&amp;:=\\{\\langle\\langle \\operatorname{jud}_N(H,\\bot)\\rangle,\\operatorname{jud}_N(H,A)\\rangle\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{AllI}_\\Sigma&amp;:=\\{\\langle\\langle \\operatorname{jud}_N(H,A[y/x])\\rangle,\\operatorname{jud}_N(H,\\forall xA)\\rangle:\\operatorname{FreeFor}_{72}(y,x,A)\\land y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(H)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(\\forall xA)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{AllE}_\\Sigma&amp;:=\\{\\langle\\langle \\operatorname{jud}_N(H,\\forall xA)\\rangle,\\operatorname{jud}_N(H,A[t/x])\\rangle:\\operatorname{FreeFor}_{72}(t,x,A)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{ExI}_\\Sigma&amp;:=\\{\\langle\\langle \\operatorname{jud}_N(H,A[t/x])\\rangle,\\operatorname{jud}_N(H,\\exists xA)\\rangle:\\operatorname{FreeFor}_{72}(t,x,A)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{ExE}_\\Sigma&amp;:=\\{\\langle\\langle \\operatorname{jud}_N(H,\\exists xA),\\operatorname{jud}_N(K,B)\\rangle,\\operatorname{jud}_N(H\\cup U_i^{A[y/x]}(K),B)\\rangle:\\\\\n&amp;\\quad G_i^{A[y/x]}(K)\\land\\operatorname{FreeFor}_{72}(y,x,A)\\land H\\cup U_i^{A[y/x]}(K)\\in\\mathsf{Asm}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(H\\cup U_i^{A[y/x]}(K))\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(B)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(\\exists xA)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{RAA}_\\Sigma&amp;:=\\{\\langle\\langle \\operatorname{jud}_N(H,\\bot)\\rangle,\\operatorname{jud}_N(U_i^{A\\to\\bot}(H),A)\\rangle:G_i^{A\\to\\bot}(H)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ImpI}_\\Sigma&amp;:=\\{\\langle\\langle \\operatorname{jud}_N(H,B)\\rangle,\\operatorname{jud}_N(U_i^A(H),A\\to B)\\rangle:G_i^A(H)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{ImpE}_\\Sigma&amp;:=\\{\\langle\\langle \\operatorname{jud}_N(H,A\\to B),\\operatorname{jud}_N(K,A)\\rangle,\\operatorname{jud}_N(H\\cup K,B)\\rangle:H\\cup K\\in\\mathsf{Asm}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{AndI}_\\Sigma&amp;:=\\{\\langle\\langle \\operatorname{jud}_N(H,A),\\operatorname{jud}_N(K,B)\\rangle,\\operatorname{jud}_N(H\\cup K,A\\land B)\\rangle:H\\cup K\\in\\mathsf{Asm}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{AndE}_\\Sigma&amp;:=\\{\\langle\\langle \\operatorname{jud}_N(H,A\\land B)\\rangle,\\operatorname{jud}_N(H,C)\\rangle:C\\in\\{A,B\\}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{OrI}_\\Sigma&amp;:=\\{\\langle\\langle \\operatorname{jud}_N(H,C)\\rangle,\\operatorname{jud}_N(H,A\\lor B)\\rangle:C\\in\\{A,B\\}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{OrE}_\\Sigma&amp;:=\\{\\langle\\langle \\operatorname{jud}_N(H,A\\lor B),\\operatorname{jud}_N(K,C),\\operatorname{jud}_N(L,C)\\rangle,\\operatorname{jud}_N(H\\cup U_i^A(K)\\cup U_j^B(L),C)\\rangle:\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{16mm}G_i^A(K)\\land G_j^B(L)\\land H\\cup U_i^A(K)\\cup U_j^B(L)\\in\\mathsf{Asm}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{TopI}_\\Sigma&amp;:=\\{\\langle\\langle\\rangle,\\operatorname{jud}_N(\\varnothing,\\top)\\rangle\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{BotE}_\\Sigma&amp;:=\\{\\langle\\langle \\operatorname{jud}_N(H,\\bot)\\rangle,\\operatorname{jud}_N(H,A)\\rangle\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{AllI}_\\Sigma&amp;:=\\{\\langle\\langle \\operatorname{jud}_N(H,A[y/x])\\rangle,\\operatorname{jud}_N(H,\\forall xA)\\rangle:\\operatorname{FreeFor}_{72}(y,x,A)\\land y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(H)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(\\forall xA)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{AllE}_\\Sigma&amp;:=\\{\\langle\\langle \\operatorname{jud}_N(H,\\forall xA)\\rangle,\\operatorname{jud}_N(H,A[t/x])\\rangle:\\operatorname{FreeFor}_{72}(t,x,A)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{ExI}_\\Sigma&amp;:=\\{\\langle\\langle \\operatorname{jud}_N(H,A[t/x])\\rangle,\\operatorname{jud}_N(H,\\exists xA)\\rangle:\\operatorname{FreeFor}_{72}(t,x,A)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{ExE}_\\Sigma&amp;:=\\{\\langle\\langle \\operatorname{jud}_N(H,\\exists xA),\\operatorname{jud}_N(K,B)\\rangle,\\operatorname{jud}_N(H\\cup U_i^{A[y/x]}(K),B)\\rangle:\\\\\n&amp;\\quad G_i^{A[y/x]}(K)\\land\\operatorname{FreeFor}_{72}(y,x,A)\\land H\\cup U_i^{A[y/x]}(K)\\in\\mathsf{Asm}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(H\\cup U_i^{A[y/x]}(K))\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(B)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(\\exists xA)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{RAA}_\\Sigma&amp;:=\\{\\langle\\langle \\operatorname{jud}_N(H,\\bot)\\rangle,\\operatorname{jud}_N(U_i^{A\\to\\bot}(H),A)\\rangle:G_i^{A\\to\\bot}(H)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal R_N&amp;:=\\{\\mathrm{ImpI}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{ImpE}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{AndI}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{AndE}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{OrI}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{OrE}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{TopI}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{BotE}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{AllI}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{AllE}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{ExI}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{ExE}_\\Sigma\\},\\\\\n\\mathbf{NJ}_\\Sigma&amp;:=\\langle Q_N,\\mathsf{Ax}_N,\\bigcup_{R\\in\\mathcal R_N}\\operatorname{Lift}_{\\mathsf{tag}_R}(R)\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathbf{NK}_\\Sigma&amp;:=\\mathbf{NJ}_\\Sigma+\\operatorname{Lift}_{\\mathsf{RAA}}(\\mathrm{RAA}_\\Sigma),\\\\\n\\operatorname{NDProof}_{\\mathcal D}(\\pi)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal D}\\quad(\\mathcal D\\in\\{\\mathbf{NJ}_\\Sigma,\\mathbf{NK}_\\Sigma\\}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{OpenAsm}(\\pi)&amp;:=\\iota H\\in\\mathsf{Asm}\\ \\exists A\\in X_N\\ (\\operatorname{Concl}(\\pi)=\\operatorname{jud}_N(H,A)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{NDConcl}(\\pi)&amp;:=\\iota A\\in X_N\\ \\exists H\\in\\mathsf{Asm}\\ (\\operatorname{Concl}(\\pi)=\\operatorname{jud}_N(H,A)),\\\\\nH\\vdash_{\\mathcal D}A&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal D}\\ (\\operatorname{Concl}(\\pi)=\\operatorname{jud}_N(H,A)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal R_N&amp;:=\\{\\mathrm{ImpI}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{ImpE}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{AndI}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{AndE}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{OrI}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{OrE}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{TopI}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{BotE}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{AllI}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{AllE}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{ExI}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{ExE}_\\Sigma\\},\\\\\n\\mathbf{NJ}_\\Sigma&amp;:=\\langle Q_N,\\mathsf{Ax}_N,\\bigcup_{R\\in\\mathcal R_N}\\operatorname{Lift}_{\\mathsf{tag}_R}(R)\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathbf{NK}_\\Sigma&amp;:=\\mathbf{NJ}_\\Sigma+\\operatorname{Lift}_{\\mathsf{RAA}}(\\mathrm{RAA}_\\Sigma),\\\\\n\\operatorname{NDProof}_{\\mathcal D}(\\pi)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal D}\\quad(\\mathcal D\\in\\{\\mathbf{NJ}_\\Sigma,\\mathbf{NK}_\\Sigma\\}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{OpenAsm}(\\pi)&amp;:=\\iota H\\in\\mathsf{Asm}\\ \\exists A\\in X_N\\ (\\operatorname{Concl}(\\pi)=\\operatorname{jud}_N(H,A)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{NDConcl}(\\pi)&amp;:=\\iota A\\in X_N\\ \\exists H\\in\\mathsf{Asm}\\ (\\operatorname{Concl}(\\pi)=\\operatorname{jud}_N(H,A)),\\\\\nH\\vdash_{\\mathcal D}A&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal D}\\ (\\operatorname{Concl}(\\pi)=\\operatorname{jud}_N(H,A)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这里实际给出有限带假设证明：叶为标号假设；每个节点的开放假设函数由其规则结论决定，→I、∨E、∃E及RAA移除指定假设类。同一类可出现多次并被一次解除，未使用的类允许空解除。假设并必须保持函数，防止同一标签被用作不同公式。Proof_N由通用五元DerivationTree构造，不借无解释的ND/closed谓词。经典规则解除A→⊥而推出A；本征变量新鲜性检查全部未解除假设与结论。原有限片段名称不再冒充完整NJ/NK；若使用原NJ^{→,∧,∨}，取本定义在该语法和对应规则中的限制。</p>\n<p>本轮深审：原 π₁/π₂ 与 72-df-proof-tree 的一基有序对投影约定一致，并非已发现的错误投影。现以判断对的唯一分解写出本地接口，使其不依赖读者记住投影编号；合法结论属于 Asm×X_N，两个唯一描述均存在且唯一，数学输出保持。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-calculus-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"3c073b947b255638","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-calculus-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-sequent-rule","status":"resolved","id":"d940a4cbbc0bf9c9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-sequent-rule]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-proof-tree","status":"resolved","id":"81c9c855e009a6d4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-proof-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-gentzen-system","status":"resolved","id":"c60a11e47ac58326","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-gentzen-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-calculus-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"3c073b947b255638","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"取 [[72-df-calculus-syntax]] 的 $X_\\Sigma$；$X_N$ 为没有原始 $\\neg$ 节点的公式，$\\neg A$ 在本文件缩写 $A\\to\\bot$。$H,K,L$ 为有限假设类标注函数，域是 $\\omega$ 的有限子集，值是 $X_N$；同一标签 $i$ 可标记多个相同公式的假设叶。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"X_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"X_N","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg A","display":false},{"tex":"A\\to\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"H,K,L","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"X_N","display":false},{"tex":"i","display":false},{"tex":"H,K,L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Asm}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B,C","display":false},{"tex":"X_N","display":false},{"tex":"i,j\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"x,y\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"Q_N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{jud}_N(H,A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle H,A\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"U_i^A(H)","display":false},{"tex":"G_i^A(H)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}(H)=\\bigcup_{A\\in\\operatorname{ran}(H)}\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{tag}_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal D\\in\\{\\mathbf{NJ}_\\Sigma,\\mathbf{NK}_\\Sigma\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal R_N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{OpenAsm}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{NDConcl}","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal D}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nX_N&:=\\{A\\in X_\\Sigma:\\neg\\exists B\\in X_\\Sigma\\ (\\langle\\mathsf{not},B\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{Sf}_{72}(A))\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{Asm}&:=\\{H\\subseteq\\omega\\times X_N:|H|\\in\\omega\\land\\forall i,A,B\\ ((\\langle i,A\\rangle\\in H\\land\\langle i,B\\rangle\\in H)\\to A=B)\\},\\\\\nQ_N&:=\\mathsf{Asm}\\times X_N,\\quad \\operatorname{jud}_N(H,A):=\\langle H,A\\rangle,\\\\\nU_i^A(H)&:=H\\setminus\\{\\langle i,A\\rangle\\},\\qquad G_i^A(H):\\Longleftrightarrow i\\notin\\operatorname{dom}(H)\\lor\\langle i,A\\rangle\\in H,\\\\\n\\mathsf{Ax}_N&:=\\{\\operatorname{jud}_N(\\{\\langle i,A\\rangle\\},A):i\\in\\omega,A\\in X_N\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ImpI}_\\Sigma&:=\\{\\langle\\langle \\operatorname{jud}_N(H,B)\\rangle,\\operatorname{jud}_N(U_i^A(H),A\\to B)\\rangle:G_i^A(H)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{ImpE}_\\Sigma&:=\\{\\langle\\langle \\operatorname{jud}_N(H,A\\to B),\\operatorname{jud}_N(K,A)\\rangle,\\operatorname{jud}_N(H\\cup K,B)\\rangle:H\\cup K\\in\\mathsf{Asm}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{AndI}_\\Sigma&:=\\{\\langle\\langle \\operatorname{jud}_N(H,A),\\operatorname{jud}_N(K,B)\\rangle,\\operatorname{jud}_N(H\\cup K,A\\land B)\\rangle:H\\cup K\\in\\mathsf{Asm}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{AndE}_\\Sigma&:=\\{\\langle\\langle \\operatorname{jud}_N(H,A\\land B)\\rangle,\\operatorname{jud}_N(H,C)\\rangle:C\\in\\{A,B\\}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{OrI}_\\Sigma&:=\\{\\langle\\langle \\operatorname{jud}_N(H,C)\\rangle,\\operatorname{jud}_N(H,A\\lor B)\\rangle:C\\in\\{A,B\\}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{OrE}_\\Sigma&:=\\{\\langle\\langle \\operatorname{jud}_N(H,A\\lor B),\\operatorname{jud}_N(K,C),\\operatorname{jud}_N(L,C)\\rangle,\\operatorname{jud}_N(H\\cup U_i^A(K)\\cup U_j^B(L),C)\\rangle:\\\\\n&\\hspace{16mm}G_i^A(K)\\land G_j^B(L)\\land H\\cup U_i^A(K)\\cup U_j^B(L)\\in\\mathsf{Asm}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{TopI}_\\Sigma&:=\\{\\langle\\langle\\rangle,\\operatorname{jud}_N(\\varnothing,\\top)\\rangle\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{BotE}_\\Sigma&:=\\{\\langle\\langle \\operatorname{jud}_N(H,\\bot)\\rangle,\\operatorname{jud}_N(H,A)\\rangle\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{AllI}_\\Sigma&:=\\{\\langle\\langle \\operatorname{jud}_N(H,A[y/x])\\rangle,\\operatorname{jud}_N(H,\\forall xA)\\rangle:\\operatorname{FreeFor}_{72}(y,x,A)\\land y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(H)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(\\forall xA)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{AllE}_\\Sigma&:=\\{\\langle\\langle \\operatorname{jud}_N(H,\\forall xA)\\rangle,\\operatorname{jud}_N(H,A[t/x])\\rangle:\\operatorname{FreeFor}_{72}(t,x,A)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{ExI}_\\Sigma&:=\\{\\langle\\langle \\operatorname{jud}_N(H,A[t/x])\\rangle,\\operatorname{jud}_N(H,\\exists xA)\\rangle:\\operatorname{FreeFor}_{72}(t,x,A)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{ExE}_\\Sigma&:=\\{\\langle\\langle \\operatorname{jud}_N(H,\\exists xA),\\operatorname{jud}_N(K,B)\\rangle,\\operatorname{jud}_N(H\\cup U_i^{A[y/x]}(K),B)\\rangle:\\\\\n&\\quad G_i^{A[y/x]}(K)\\land\\operatorname{FreeFor}_{72}(y,x,A)\\land H\\cup U_i^{A[y/x]}(K)\\in\\mathsf{Asm}\\\\\n&\\quad\\land y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(H\\cup U_i^{A[y/x]}(K))\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(B)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(\\exists xA)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{RAA}_\\Sigma&:=\\{\\langle\\langle \\operatorname{jud}_N(H,\\bot)\\rangle,\\operatorname{jud}_N(U_i^{A\\to\\bot}(H),A)\\rangle:G_i^{A\\to\\bot}(H)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal R_N&:=\\{\\mathrm{ImpI}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{ImpE}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{AndI}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{AndE}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{OrI}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{OrE}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{TopI}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{BotE}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{AllI}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{AllE}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{ExI}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{ExE}_\\Sigma\\},\\\\\n\\mathbf{NJ}_\\Sigma&:=\\langle Q_N,\\mathsf{Ax}_N,\\bigcup_{R\\in\\mathcal R_N}\\operatorname{Lift}_{\\mathsf{tag}_R}(R)\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathbf{NK}_\\Sigma&:=\\mathbf{NJ}_\\Sigma+\\operatorname{Lift}_{\\mathsf{RAA}}(\\mathrm{RAA}_\\Sigma),\\\\\n\\operatorname{NDProof}_{\\mathcal D}(\\pi)&:\\Longleftrightarrow\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal D}\\quad(\\mathcal D\\in\\{\\mathbf{NJ}_\\Sigma,\\mathbf{NK}_\\Sigma\\}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{OpenAsm}(\\pi)&:=\\iota H\\in\\mathsf{Asm}\\ \\exists A\\in X_N\\ (\\operatorname{Concl}(\\pi)=\\operatorname{jud}_N(H,A)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{NDConcl}(\\pi)&:=\\iota A\\in X_N\\ \\exists H\\in\\mathsf{Asm}\\ (\\operatorname{Concl}(\\pi)=\\operatorname{jud}_N(H,A)),\\\\\nH\\vdash_{\\mathcal D}A&:\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal D}\\ (\\operatorname{Concl}(\\pi)=\\operatorname{jud}_N(H,A)).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":6869,"backlinks":[{"id":"494fa4cd0ce92258","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma_A=\\langle\\{0\\},\\{S,+,\\cdot\\},a_F,\\{<\\},a_R\\rangle$，$a_F(S)=1$、$a_F(+)=a_F(\\cdot)=2$、$a_R(<)=2$。取 [[72-df-natural-deduction]] 的 $X_N$ 及实际有限 $\\mathbf{NJ}_{\\Sigma_A}$；所有对象变量是 $v_i$。"},{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-104","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-natural-deduction|df-natural-deduction — Natural Deduction]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-102","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[df-natural-deduction — Natural Deduction](72-df-natural-deduction.md)"},{"id":"5a339e72892676e7","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$Q_N=\\mathsf{Asm}\\times X_N$、$\\operatorname{jud}_N(H,A)$ 取 [[72-df-natural-deduction]]。$\\mathfrak M=\\langle D,I_C,I_F,I_R\\rangle$ 是签名 $\\Sigma$ 的合法非空身份等号结构，$s\\in D^V$；公式真值取 [[72-df-propositional-evaluation]]。"},{"id":"8aee8d29de8710d2","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal N}$，$\\mathcal N\\in\\{\\mathbf{NJ}_\\Sigma,\\mathbf{NK}_\\Sigma\\}$；$\\operatorname{OpenAsm}$ 